## Errors, limits, retries, and idempotency

| Code/condition | Meaning | Safe response |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `400` | Invalid input | Correct input; do not retry unchanged |
| `401/403` | Authentication/authorization failure | Stop; verify binding and scope |
| `409` | Conflict/concurrency failure | Read current state before any mutation |
| `429` | Rate limit | Honor provider guidance and bounded backoff |
| Unknown write outcome | Result not established | Do not replay blindly; read back first |

Document request IDs, idempotency keys, pagination, caching, timeouts, retryable methods, and budgets where the contract supports them.

